    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Runqueues and Task Selection",
      "source_hash": 6192104872672185085,
      "context_hash": 10687154830488879395,
      "translation": "런큐와 태스크 선택",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:03.989146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Per-CPU runqueues, struct rq, and how the scheduler picks the next task",
      "source_hash": 15255388142899723479,
      "context_hash": 10197552724026524279,
      "translation": "CPU별 런큐, struct rq, 그리고 스케줄러가 다음 태스크를 고르는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "runqueue": "런큐",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:03.989147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The per-CPU design",
      "source_hash": 2040296237978446774,
      "context_hash": 2360222098364987505,
      "translation": "CPU별 설계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:03.989147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Every CPU has its own runqueue.",
      "source_hash": 12839495261940066120,
      "context_hash": 5137752366222487506,
      "translation": "모든 CPU는 자신만의 런큐를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:03.989147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "There is no global queue of runnable tasks — each CPU independently manages its own set and picks from it.",
      "source_hash": 13609459487735395289,
      "context_hash": 687637475498186559,
      "translation": "실행 가능한 태스크의 전역 큐는 없습니다 — 각 CPU가 자신의 태스크 집합을 독립적으로 관리하고 그 안에서 태스크를 고릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:03.989147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "This design scales: CPUs never contend on a shared lock just to pick the next task.",
      "source_hash": 14693707754828605671,
      "context_hash": 8458233167260903059,
      "translation": "이 설계는 확장성이 좋습니다: CPU들은 다음 태스크를 고르기 위해 공유 락을 두고 경쟁하는 일이 결코 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:03.989147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Load balancing periodically migrates tasks between CPUs to keep them busy, but that's separate from the per-CPU selection path.",
      "source_hash": 5816938068726578379,
      "context_hash": 5624440623373071075,
      "translation": "부하 분산은 CPU들을 바쁘게 유지하기 위해 주기적으로 태스크를 CPU 간에 이동시키지만, 이는 CPU별 선택 경로와는 별개입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "load balancing": "부하 분산"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:03.989147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
