    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The `tasks_timeline` RB-tree holds all runnable fair tasks, ordered by `vruntime`.",
      "source_hash": 9939811026390729811,
      "context_hash": 5098207650465808088,
      "translation": "`tasks_timeline` RB 트리는 실행 가능한 모든 fair 태스크를 `vruntime` 순으로 정렬하여 보관합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012398Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The `rb_root_cached` variant caches the leftmost node for O(1) access, though since EEVDF the leftmost node is no longer always selected — but the cache remains useful as a starting point for the tree walk.",
      "source_hash": 17454833760494651486,
      "context_hash": 15834616274341069260,
      "translation": "`rb_root_cached` 변형은 O(1) 접근을 위해 가장 왼쪽 노드를 캐시합니다. EEVDF 도입 이후로는 가장 왼쪽 노드가 항상 선택되지는 않지만, 이 캐시는 트리 탐색의 시작점으로서 여전히 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF",
        "cache": "캐시",
        "caches": "캐시",
        "node": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012398Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "struct rt_rq (RT tasks)",
      "source_hash": 4718500967194798095,
      "context_hash": 11444885719139967816,
      "translation": "struct rt_rq(RT 태스크)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012398Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "RT task selection is O(1): `sched_find_first_bit(bitmap)` finds the highest-priority non-empty queue, then takes the head of that queue.",
      "source_hash": 16588850563370667647,
      "context_hash": 17874272546637011604,
      "translation": "RT 태스크 선택은 O(1)입니다. `sched_find_first_bit(bitmap)`이 비어 있지 않은 큐 중 우선순위가 가장 높은 큐를 찾은 다음, 그 큐의 맨 앞 태스크를 가져옵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RT task": "RT 태스크",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012399Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "struct dl_rq (deadline tasks)",
      "source_hash": 6934307146170932675,
      "context_hash": 9678337378415642814,
      "translation": "struct dl_rq(deadline 태스크)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012399Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Deadline task selection picks the task with the earliest `dl_deadline` from the RB-tree — similar to EEVDF but for absolute (not virtual) deadlines.",
      "source_hash": 6376060629042000446,
      "context_hash": 7972462562704539469,
      "translation": "Deadline 태스크 선택은 RB 트리에서 `dl_deadline`이 가장 이른 태스크를 고릅니다. EEVDF와 비슷하지만 가상 deadline이 아닌 절대 deadline을 기준으로 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012399Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The scheduling decision",
      "source_hash": 14882548044018688242,
      "context_hash": 17859240811491584694,
      "translation": "스케줄링 결정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012399Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The core of the scheduler lives in `__schedule()` in `kernel/sched/core.c`:",
      "source_hash": 2655938909303034408,
      "context_hash": 11305086968160040146,
      "translation": "스케줄러의 핵심은 `kernel/sched/core.c`의 `__schedule()`에 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012399Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "pick_next_task()",
      "source_hash": 5322238104550585666,
      "context_hash": 13759076347488300872,
      "translation": "pick_next_task()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012399Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Walks the scheduler class hierarchy until a class has a task:",
      "source_hash": 2306489022366656831,
      "context_hash": 12181867361886441468,
      "translation": "태스크를 가진 클래스가 나올 때까지 스케줄러 클래스 계층을 차례로 순회합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012399Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The fast path skips the class walk entirely when all tasks are SCHED_NORMAL (the common case on most systems).",
      "source_hash": 2478454527036498884,
      "context_hash": 9307048911354072640,
      "translation": "빠른 경로는 모든 태스크가 SCHED_NORMAL일 때(대부분의 시스템에서 흔한 경우) 클래스 순회를 완전히 건너뜁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fast path": "빠른 경로"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012400Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "This saves checking three higher-priority classes that almost never have tasks.",
      "source_hash": 17488124376618391594,
      "context_hash": 1219724388943776845,
      "translation": "이를 통해 태스크를 거의 갖지 않는 상위 우선순위 클래스 세 개를 확인하는 비용을 절약합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012400Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "context_switch()",
      "source_hash": 1277681410631138199,
      "context_hash": 9897595256170116289,
      "translation": "context_switch()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012400Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Once `next` is selected, `context_switch()` switches execution:",
      "source_hash": 12947950497535756919,
      "context_hash": 11925111128533001815,
      "translation": "`next`가 선택되면 `context_switch()`가 실행을 전환합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012400Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`switch_to()` is architecture-specific.",
      "source_hash": 16307273905519919494,
      "context_hash": 3935251213990062100,
      "translation": "`switch_to()`는 아키텍처마다 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012400Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "On x86-64 it saves/restores registers and switches the stack pointer.",
      "source_hash": 2503653853291319983,
      "context_hash": 319831357952506999,
      "translation": "x86-64에서는 레지스터를 저장/복원하고 스택 포인터를 전환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012400Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "After `switch_to()`, execution continues in `next`'s context — `prev` is whatever task ran before `next` last yielded.",
      "source_hash": 8013090013002557576,
      "context_hash": 11870707813686799351,
      "translation": "`switch_to()` 이후에는 `next`의 컨텍스트에서 실행이 계속되며, `prev`는 `next`가 마지막으로 CPU를 양보하기 전에 실행되던 태스크입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012400Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Runqueue clock",
      "source_hash": 1726683134296993353,
      "context_hash": 13310898458524645377,
      "translation": "런큐 클럭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012401Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`rq->clock` is a nanosecond-precision monotonic clock per CPU, updated at each scheduling event:",
      "source_hash": 7025996457618014540,
      "context_hash": 14738362223260055006,
      "translation": "`rq->clock`은 CPU별 나노초 정밀도의 단조 클럭으로, 각 스케줄링 이벤트마다 갱신됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012401Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "CFS uses `rq_clock_task()` (not wall time) for vruntime updates, which means time spent in a VM guest doesn't count toward the host task's CPU consumption.",
      "source_hash": 4761396718622370595,
      "context_hash": 778853678740899140,
      "translation": "CFS는 vruntime 갱신에 벽시계 시간(wall time)이 아닌 `rq_clock_task()`를 사용하며, 따라서 VM 게스트에서 소비된 시간은 호스트 태스크의 CPU 사용량에 포함되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS",
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "guest": "게스트",
        "host": "호스트",
        "vruntime": "vruntime"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:45.012401Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing runqueue state",
      "source_hash": 15764981869568380435,
      "context_hash": 13203695802902507794,
      "translation": "런큐 상태 관찰",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
